# No AI keys are needed at build time: each user enters their own keys in the app (stored on the device
# with expo-secure-store). Only the OpenRouter key is required. Gemini (better chat, Live voice, voice output)
# and Groq (chat backup, speech-to-text for Fallback voice) are optional.
# The old Worker proxy variables (EXPO_PUBLIC_PROXY_URL / EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_TOKEN) are no longer used by the app.
